{"unit_id":"Moon-shiyue__dsh-github-connect#card-card-zh","repo":"Moon-shiyue/dsh-github-connect","commit":"d7ec9e72cdf9ee31fe661562eb5f33076f3ce9d8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github-connect 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的 GitHub 连接插件。它在对话输入栏旁添加按钮和连接面板，支持 OAuth 设备流或个人访问令牌。连接后，AI 可用 github_api 向 GitHub REST API 发起读写请求，管理仓库、议题、拉取请求、Gist、工作流和内容。用户可查看连接状态并断开账号；凭据默认保存在本机 DSH home。设备流需要自己的 OAuth App Client ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:18-30","lib/client.js:80-159","lib/index.js:513-620","lib/index.js:638-665"]}
{"unit_id":"Moon-shiyue__dsh-github-connect#card-card-en","repo":"Moon-shiyue/dsh-github-connect","commit":"d7ec9e72cdf9ee31fe661562eb5f33076f3ce9d8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-github-connect links GitHub to DSH chat using OAuth device flow or a personal access token. The assistant can use github_api to read and update repositories, issues, pull requests, gists, and workflows. Users can check status or disconnect. Credentials stay in the local DSH home.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:18-30","lib/client.js:80-159","lib/index.js:513-620","lib/index.js:638-665"]}
